      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Niño",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Niño, vente conmigo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Escúchame, te cuento unas cosas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "De unos hombres, ay",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Estos hombres eran hombres bravos",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Llegaban de África con la fuerza y la belleza",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Ay, mijo, conquistaban la ignorancia",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Y las bestias de la humanidad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Daban al mundo la luz y la fe",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Y también el dios cósmico",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Los llamamos los conquistadores chocolates",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "(It's yours)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCABBDEAFG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCABBBBABD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Legitimize living lies, channel the cosmos",
          "rhyme": "os",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "These God flows here to civilize",
          "rhyme": "Ez",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Hear them footsteps, here come the Moors",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Neanderthals in scores, eatin’ wild boars",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Thousands of yеars on tour, organize y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Wild whores smellin' likе animals through the pores on all fours",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Foul cannibals, hear the roars",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Raw flesh, rebellious and lawless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Taught by the autochthonous, all bless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "All dressed in garbs of royalty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Gods, who swore to be, righteous laws accordingly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Educated by the highly elevated",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Melanated and mind renovated",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Once they stumble across the right answer (It’s yours)",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Remarkably similar to Wakanda, white panther",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Herbs combat cancer",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Detoxin' the liver, sexual enhancers",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Symbolisms in Hollywood, jolly good",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Shows us how evil will manifest, or prob'ly could",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Divine beings, mind freeing",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Conquistadores chocolates",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFDGGHHIIJKKILMNO",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDAEDBBFFGGHBBGECID"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Dates of fake history to erase",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Comin' through the corridors of deep space",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "High beings",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "All-eye seein', find meaning, clairvoyant, mind reading",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Nervous system, serve as wisdom",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Flow superior, determine rhythm",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Electricity, eccentricity",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Afrocentric synchronicity",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "In the air everywhere, takin' over",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Chocolate conquerors, supernova",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Educatin', dominatin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Time deflatin’, bomb on Satan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Wicked is gone, shorn and shaken",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "The force awakens (It’s time)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Back to them caves",
          "rhyme": "av",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Conquistadores chocolates",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
